.gsxg-readable strong{color:#f1c96d;}
@media(max-width:900px){.gsxg-wrap{font-size:17px}.gsxg-section{padding:54px 18px!important}}</style><div class="gsxg-wrap"><section class="gsxg-section gsxg-hero"><div class="gsxg-inner"><div class="gsxg-kicker">GoldStandardX Gaming</div><h1 class="gsxg-title">Our Servers</h1><p class="gsxg-lead">Browse every GSXG community. Each server now has its own page with its own rules, events, updates, and info &mdash; because PvE, PvP, and roleplay all play by different rules.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://discord.gg/4xEgrdQbFG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Main Community Discord</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/">Back Home</a></div></div></section><section class="gsxg-section gsxg-band"><div class="gsxg-inner"><div class="gsxg-heading"><div><div class="gsxg-kicker">How It Works</div><h2>Rules & Events Are Per Server</h2></div><p>Click <strong>Open Server Page</strong> on any community below. Each server page has that community&rsquo;s own rules, events, updates, and links &mdash; so Hornet Heaven (PvE) and Final Order (PvP) each keep their own rules instead of one shared list.</p></div></div></section><section class="gsxg-section"><div class="gsxg-inner"><div class="gsxg-heading"><div><div class="gsxg-kicker">Server Network</div><h2>Active Communities</h2></div><p>Every community has its own logo spot and its own server page. Logos show when artwork is uploaded; reserved logo slots stay in place until the rest of the artwork is added.</p></div><div class="gsxg-grid"><div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">GSXG<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Community</span><h3>GoldStandardX Community Hub</h3><p>The main GSXG Discord for announcements, cross-server community, support, events, staff applications, partner applications, and network-wide updates.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/community-hub/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/4xEgrdQbFG" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a><a class="gsxg-btn red" href="https://sites.google.com/view/goldstandardx-gaming" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">FO<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Rust • PvP</span><h3>Final Order</h3><p>A full Rust PvP ecosystem built for builders, grinders, raiders, and long-term community survival.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/final-order/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/7Vs2CJ8P7n" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a><a class="gsxg-btn red" href="https://www.rustfinalorder.org/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><img src="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/final-order-console-edition.png" alt="FO logo" loading="lazy"></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Rust Console</span><h3>Final Order Console Edition</h3><p>Final Order for Rust Console Edition players, built around the same GSXG standard for fair play, support, events, and community growth.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/final-order-console/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/7Vs2CJ8P7n" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a><a class="gsxg-btn red" href="https://www.rustfinalorder.org/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Website</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">AOW<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">ARK</span><h3>Ark of War</h3><p>A long-term ARK community focused on taming, building, progression, boss runs, and coordinated survival.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/ark-of-war/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/kQQ6DxTcdr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">LBS<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">DayZ / 7 Days</span><h3>Last Breath Survival</h3><p>Apocalypse survival for players who want danger, progression, teamwork, and a home across DayZ and 7 Days to Die.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/last-breath-survival/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/Cq8fRnPxjm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">WE<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Conan</span><h3>Warborn Exiles</h3><p>A Conan Exiles community built around clans, building, conflict, rules, and a strong admin standard.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/warborn-exiles/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/V5A3SJDPt3" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">ECS<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Minecraft</span><h3>EmberCraft Survival</h3><p>Minecraft survival for players who enjoy building, economy, progression, community projects, and seasonal updates.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/embercraft-survival/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/AsAWq2DTXU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">EK<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Enshrouded</span><h3>Emberveil Kingdom</h3><p>A fantasy survival community focused on exploration, crafting, building, cooperative progression, and realm growth.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/emberveil-kingdom/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/uc7nUATXn9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">CO<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">SCUM</span><h3>Convict Outbreak</h3><p>Hardcore survival, looting, base building, and player-driven stories in the SCUM universe.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/convict-outbreak/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/FYWbQXmV54" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">PS<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Icarus</span><h3>Prospectors Survival</h3><p>Mission-focused survival for players who like exploration, resource planning, crafting, and squad progression.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/prospectors-survival/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/nTggx7u9zB" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><img src="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/windrose-frontier-network.png" alt="WFN logo" loading="lazy"></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Frontier Network</span><h3>Windrose Frontier Network</h3><p>A frontier-themed community built for exploration, survival, roleplay potential, and future GSXG expansion.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/windrose-frontier-network/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/Yu4B2mdyhQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><img src="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/metrolife-rp.png" alt="ML logo" loading="lazy"></div><span class="gsxg-tag">GTA V Roleplay</span><h3>MetroLife RP</h3><p>A GTA V roleplay community centered on city life, emergency services, economy, character stories, and organized RP.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/metrolife-rp/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/Yu4B2mdyhQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">GS<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Other Games</span><h3>Gaming Server</h3><p>A flexible home for new games, test communities, events, future servers, and network experiments.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/gaming-server/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/Yu4B2mdyhQ" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">FB<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Soulmask</span><h3>Fallen Bloodline</h3><p>Tribe survival, crafting, exploration, and group progression for Soulmask players.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/fallen-bloodline/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/38WjMttgad" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div>
<div class="gsxg-card"><div class="gsxg-logo-slot"><span class="gsxg-logo-placeholder">HH<br>Logo Slot</span></div><span class="gsxg-tag">Rust PvE</span><h3>Hornet Heaven</h3><p>Custom Rust PvE with quality-of-life features, community progression, relaxed survival, and custom content.</p><div class="gsxg-actions"><a class="gsxg-btn primary" href="https://yellowgreen-jay-473493.hostingersite.com/our-servers/hornet-heaven/">Open Server Page</a><a class="gsxg-btn dark" href="https://discord.gg/bFsCT43hbY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Join Discord</a></div></div></div></div></section></div>]]></content:encoded>
